  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The increasing order of the reactivity of the following with <math><mtext>L</mtext><mtext>i</mtext><mtext>A</mtext><mtext>l</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> is:<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"111\" src=\"assets\\qt0049_9f3fc067b3fc.png\" width=\"205\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"110\" src=\"assets\\qt0049_6c37662f8bd1.png\" width=\"221\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"109\" src=\"assets\\qt0049_0b0dfe5be512.png\" width=\"181\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"112\" src=\"assets\\qt0049_a51522fa8cfa.png\" width=\"320\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
